☐ Update architecture documentation with a Mermaid resolution diagram.
☐ Update the native-screen proposal to replace explicit-root common examples.
☐ Add the capability and compatibility behavior to `CHANGELOG.md`.
☐ Check all docs for claims that `viewscreen.widgets` contains every base-game
  control.

Exit gate:

☐ Public declarations, implementation, tests, examples, and architecture use
  the same path terminology.
☐ Every graph in the updated documentation uses Mermaid.

